  "method": "Black box at the process boundary: each case starts or reuses a gateway process with a fresh HOME and cwd, a minimal environment (no inherited variables, no *_API_KEY), credentials off unless the case supplies a temp file store with fake keys, and every outbound connection through the suite's egress proxy (provider hosts TLS-terminated locally to mocks, all others refused). Assertions are on HTTP status, headers, bodies, SSE frames, bytes sent upstream, child argv/stdin/environment, exit codes, files and log rows. Normalised: latency_ms, timestamps (RFC3339 fields compared by shape or relation), uptime, ephemeral ports and temp paths. Never normalised: resolved model, cost amount/class/est_usd/charged_usd, error class and code, missing terminal events, upstream request counts.",
